  annotation = {中文辅助译名：基于PSAF仿真分析的中频炉滤波器研究},
  abstract = {When high power intermediate frequency furnace's electrical equipment is service,its rated current is higher,the capacity of needed filter is bigger and its load changes intensely.On the basis of the above characteristics,this paper proposes to adopt passive power filter(PPF) to eliminate harmonic pollution.To prevent passive aggressive behavior when the system is no-load,PSAF is adopted to analyze harmonic's characteristics generated by intermediate frequency furnace and influences of impedance frequency perturbation on filter effect which are used for verification of PPF's feasibility and effectiveness.},
