  annotation = {中文辅助译名：超声检查在宫外孕监测中的价值},
  abstract = {Objective To investigate the clinical value of ultrasonography in ectopic pregnancy diagnosis and drug induced abortion monitor.Method We retrospectively analyzed 79 patients in our hospital who had ectopic pregnancy and 12 patients who had drug induced abortion by ultrasonography.Results Of the 79 ectopic pregnancy patients diagnosed by ultrasonography,77 patients were made a definite diagnosis through surgery and drug induced abortion.The diagnostic accordance rate was 97%.2 patients were missed(3%).11 patients were registered as shrunken or disappeared embryo by methotrexate and 5-fluorouracil.Conclusion The ultrasonography is one of the best way in diagnosing ectopic pregnancy.},
}

